      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "UPDATE: FUCK VRCHAT! Today I was streaming and playing beat saber, I was having issues with beat saber so I switched over to playing VRC, but the moment I LAUNCHED THE GAME it gave me the Failed to launch graphic then it fucking Blue screened my computer.\n\nWhat I had open when I launched it:\n\nDiscord, OperaGX, SteamVR, LIV, Steam, Stream labs.\n\nThis is complete BULLSHIT, you guys want more information? WELL I FUCKING CANT! This is literally all I can give you, and if you guys can't FUCKING fix this, I'm done! It's complete bullshit that you guys ignore this shit. FIX THE FUCKING GAME DEVS!",
