  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, I'm experiencing a very horrible issue with VRC that makes me not want to play the game anymore. A few days ago and yesterday I launched VRC (No I don't have mods or anything installed that would affect the launch), it would then say after loading it has an issue with the launch then immediately my computer will freeze up and blue-screen. This has happened three times in total and I've never had this happen before, it only started after the rollback update recently. I don't know what is causing this issue but, I know its not my computer cause I can play other games that use EAC, so something you guys have done has broken the game completely on my system, I was able to fix it slightly by reinstalling VRC, but yesterday I was hopping on and it bluescreened my computer (and this was the one I reinstalled previously) I really don't want to have to wait for a few hours to uninstall then reinstall VRC to play the game.",
